        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Remove `:packupdate` windows when session file is loaded.\n\nIf 'sessionoptions' doesn't already have a flag that we can use, then perhaps we need one. \n\nAnd while we're at it, we might want to update 'shada' to include `,rnvim-pack:`. Maybe sessions could use the 'shada' `r` flag as a hint.\n",
            "created_at": "2026-07-04T14:40:20Z",
